      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "f5df1e8e-f440-4e28-a995-26a4b62a86bc",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "186c1278-d3b2-45ef-afaa-e173a03e6c4e",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "2b9014d6-ed8b-4f7b-a924-95ad3a6ccb01",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Nib reads the\nproposed\nsettlement:\nverified repair\ncosts are repaid",
                      "from the public\nfund in recorded\ninstallments. No\ntenant loses a",
                      "home to pay it.\nSlush gives up the\nsealed estate\npriority. The city",
                      "takes an actual\ndebt, not a\nflattering favor."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "01955277-ddf6-4fd3-ae4a-af4ffb61c82a",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4f54feee-b281-4af9-a451-ac9a2d6a8a53",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "30bc2930-2da6-429c-a39b-99cc03420f87",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "491b7f0e-9f5a-4343-a2e7-6693d8f00d9e",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "c2104101-6b23-4797-a17e-3205508cce12",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Before choosing a\nmechanical\nreplacement, whose\nassigned work must",
                      "occur in the\nexample? The\nresident report is\nreal and should be",
                      "acknowledged. It\ndoes not by itself\nidentify which\npart failed.",
                      "Choose the missing\nverification\nhandoff, so the\nduty register",
                      "protects both the\nresident from\ndelay and the\nbuilder from\nrepairing",
                      "a guess."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "ecf45f84-1416-4d95-a759-58fbb7a7a828",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edb47dfe-7793-4b36-a757-5c62c6125015",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "c409dcf2-8fa6-4752-a1e2-de6a9c3491ad",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "76608427-cedb-4a7f-a759-869e44f5cf88",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "a2679009-89b3-4559-a104-84945fb6de71",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Slush: I still\nprefer a building\nwith my name on\nit. But a city\nthat",
                      "works is a better\nneighbor than an\nestate surrounded\nby cold. He",
                      "offers the\numbrella to Pip,\nwho discovers it\nis heavy because\nthe",
                      "handle stores\ntwelve emergency\nforms."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "35e98708-51bb-4bc7-a2c7-369fa1c4d7c3",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
